\ cv8-fuse-loopall.4 - the run-time loop compiler for a design that has
\ ALL EIGHT loop opcodes: (DO) (LOOP) (+LOOP) (?DO) (LEAVE) I J UNLOOP
\ (Iteration 43). Loaded instead of cv8-fuse-loop.4 for designs with the
\ genes rtloop and rtloopall (lab/evolve) - seven of the ten rtloop
\ designs on seed 8's front have all eight.
\
\ cv8-fuse-loop.4 serves any subset: every word there keeps a fallback to
\ the word it replaces, which keeps those words alive, and chooses between
\ the 16-bit and the cell chain of pending LEAVEs at compile time. Here
\ there is nothing to fall back to and one chain - 16 bits - so the
\ replaced words go (the gene lean), and the three tables are one: about
\ 270 of rtloop's ~470 bytes.
\
\ LOOPTAB, written by the converter (tools/layout.py): bytes 0-4 the five
\ operand loop opcodes, 5-7 I J UNLOOP's; 8-9 I's image offset; 10 and 11
\ J's and UNLOOP's distance past I - the three are neighbours in the
\ kernel. A ['] here would hold the cell system's address.

CREATE LOOPTAB ( --- c-addr )   0 C, 0 C, 0 C, 0 C, 0 C, 0 C, 0 C, 0 C, 0 C, 0 C, 0 C, 0 C,
ALIGN

: W@ ( a --- u )   DUP C@ SWAP 1+ C@ 8 LSHIFT OR ;

: COMPILE,8 ( xt --- )
\ The COMPILE,8 before this one, and I J UNLOOP as their opcodes.
  DUP START @ - LOOPTAB 8 + W@ -
  DUP 0= IF DROP LOOPTAB 5 + ELSE
  DUP LOOPTAB 10 + C@ = IF DROP LOOPTAB 6 + ELSE
  LOOPTAB 11 + C@ = IF LOOPTAB 7 + ELSE COMPILE,8 EXIT THEN THEN THEN
  C@ SWAP DROP 0 LAST-OP ! OP, ;

: RESOLVE-LEAVE16 ( --- )
\ Each pending (?DO) or (LEAVE) operand - which holds the distance back to
\ the one before, or 0 - gets its offset to HERE, the loop's end.
  'LEAVE @ BEGIN ?DUP WHILE
    DUP W@ >R  HERE OVER - OVER !W
    R> ?DUP IF - ELSE DROP 0 THEN
  REPEAT ;

: LOOP, ( a-addr op --- )   OP, <RESOLVE RESOLVE-LEAVE16 'LEAVE ! ;

: DO8 ( --- a-addr )   0 LAST-OP ! LOOPTAB C@ OP, 'LEAVE @ HERE 0 'LEAVE ! ; IMMEDIATE
: LOOP8 ( a-addr --- )   LOOPTAB 1+ C@ LOOP, ; IMMEDIATE
: +LOOP8 ( a-addr --- )   LOOPTAB 2 + C@ LOOP, ; IMMEDIATE
: ?DO8 ( --- a-addr )
  0 LAST-OP ! LOOPTAB 3 + C@ OP, 'LEAVE @ HERE 'LEAVE ! 0 W, HERE ; IMMEDIATE
: LEAVE8 ( --- )
  0 LAST-OP ! LOOPTAB 4 + C@ OP,
  HERE 'LEAVE @ ?DUP IF HERE SWAP - ELSE 0 THEN W, 'LEAVE ! ; IMMEDIATE
